## 4. How to Run the Repository

1.  **Clone the Repository:**
    ```bash
    git clone https://github.com/yourusername/probabilistic-zenml-pipeline.git
    cd probabilistic-zenml-pipeline
    ```
2.  **Install Required Dependencies:**
    ```bash
    pip install numpy zenml
    ```
3.  **Initialize ZenML Local Stack:**
    ```bash
    zenml init
    ```
4.  **Execute the Production Pipeline:**
    ```bash
    python run_pipeline.py
    ```
5.  **Visualize Pipeline in ZenML Dashboard:**
    ```bash
    zenml up
    ```

